<title>USA: U.S. Surgical gets FDA ok for ABBI labeling.</title>
<headline>U.S. Surgical gets FDA ok for ABBI labeling.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>United States Surgical Corp said Thursday that the Food and Drug Administration has approved a new 510(k) for its ABBI Breast Biopsy System, satisfactorily resolving all labeling issues.</p>
<p>The new approval, which replaces the previous 510(k), incorporates clinical data submitted on 312 patients, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;There are now no outstanding FDA issues regarding the ABBI* Breast Biopsy System,&quot; U.S. Surgical said in a release.</p>
</text>
